c-sponsored survey near the low end.\n\nMost expert raters place the race at Likely Republican, though a few see it as Lean Republican and one calls it a Tossup, and prediction markets give Crane roughly a two-in-three chance. A Trump-aligned super PAC ad that used a photo of the wrong Native American man to attack Nez drew wide criticism in October, a possible sympathy boost for Nez, but the district's lean and Crane's incumbency still favor the Republican.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1703, "margin": -5.61}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2296, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2331, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2721, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1924, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2064, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2601, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2994, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2375, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.2081, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2582, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2605, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2646, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2228, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2228, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.2377, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2118, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2006, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2187, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.1855, "margin": -5.0}]}